  "briefing": {
    "title": "Code Blue",
    "body": "Code blue! When a monitor goes flat or zigzags, that heart has stopped. Start CPR and hit the beats. Grab the crash cart: zigzag means shock, flat means an adrenaline shot. It takes two of you to bring them back. Once they have a pulse, one person can stay with them.",
    "fact": "Good CPR is about 100 to 120 compressions a minute."
  },
